{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27968","headline":"和处州韦使君新开南溪 · 朱庆余","name":"和处州韦使君新开南溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地里光图谶，樵人共说深。\n悠然想高躅，坐使变荒岑。\n疏凿因殊旧，亭台亦自今。\n静容猨暂下，闲与鹤同寻。\n转斾驯禽起，褰帷瀑溜侵。\n石稀潭见底，岚暗树无阴。\n跻险难通屐，攀栖称抱琴。\n云风开物意，潭水识人心。\n携榼巡花遍，移舟惜景沈。\n世嫌山水僻，谁伴谢公吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}